  $body$[LINK: YOUR CI PROVIDER'S DOCS ON THE RELEVANT STEP, e.g. caching or matrix builds]. [LINK: YOUR PACKAGE MANAGER'S LOCKFILE DOCS, IF THIS IS A DEPENDENCY ISSUE].$body$,
  $body$A correct response includes: a clear diagnosis of which category the failure falls into (regression / environment drift / CI config), the specific root cause within that category, a fix, and — if the cause was an environment difference — a note on how to prevent CI and local from drifting again (e.g. pinning versions, matching Node/runtime versions).$body$
)
